      "method": "Three focused regressions, the existing firecracker control and all 178 Rust tests passed after genuine paused-player RED failures. Covers strict radius, visual preservation, pause/unpause during a real grenade fuse, defense/protection and once-only lethal attribution/finalization. Formatting, warning-denied Clippy, release and complete package checks passed.",
