      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "url": "https://github.com/OpenRotMG/Open-RotMG-Server/pull/289#issuecomment-6317820590",
      "method": "Clean base eb85988: paused native HP fell 840→816 from three direct artifact hits of 8 and 840→762 from a delayed grenade hit of 78. Clean a886831: both native characters stayed at 840 HP, Paused21 and alive while explicit active controls received the same source damage. Native diagnostics, retained ELF and package hashes match.",
      "limitations": "Prepared natural encounters: one real native Human plus a separately identified scripted/direct positive control, not two-native or earned-progression acceptance. Controls later died; their survival or AoE-caused death is not claimed. Raw state/events establish numeric HP; grey screenshots alone do not. No peak-circle, original encounter timing or complete ACK/effect acceptance is implied.",
